REM  This file is re-written by RoboHELP
REM  whenever REDCAT SPOOKKASTEEL.rtf is saved.
REM
REM  However, the numeric values stored in         
REM  REDCAT SPOOKKASTEEL.hh are the 'master values' and if you  
REM  modify the value in REDCAT SPOOKKASTEEL.hh and then        
REM  save the REDCAT SPOOKKASTEEL.rtf again, this file will 
REM  reflect the changed values.                   
REM
